{"ID":"20240513083451-7ac5c2c","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083451-7ac5c2c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083451-7ac5c2c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513095503-0b901fn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513095503-0b901fn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513095503-0b901fn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:454,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:454\u0026#125;","title":"010","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124741"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513095503-0b901fn","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 810px;","id":"20240513095503-0b901fn","updated":"20240515124741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：20080506"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"255-2 Z, LB"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37歲,高略瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080509"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳腺癌移轉肺癌"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方后"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡(昨夜很好12:00AM-8:00AM)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便一日1-2次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 雙足溫熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 口不乾,不覺渴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→裡寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 小便淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 胃口很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 上身熱,小腿涼"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→陰陽不和"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 服藥第一晚被痰憋醒，咳出很多痰"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→桔梗甘草湯，藥到了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寸脈大於尺脈(陽回來了)，胃氣在,緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左眼肺區黃塊,中有黑點(腫瘤)胰區尚好,肝區有損傷及圈紋 瞳孔大(被嚇到了),心區白(心血虛),扁(心陽不足)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手溫額熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陽氣回復中,心陰陽兩虛"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5/6 加"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢  玉金五錢  龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→清肝，治肺必治肝，令病不進，且改善睡眠品質"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃芩三錢  黃連二錢  白芍五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→幫助睡眠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改生附子三錢(另包)  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf B/S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.服用陽藥後病人陽氣漸復,表示身體能受藥"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.5/5日節氣為立夏,對陽氣恢復極有利"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.須忌口, 避免如肉,奶製品等含荷爾蒙之物"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}